        "Chicken breasts or thighs",
        "Garlic",
        "Shallots"
      ]
    },
    {
      "do": "Toss the chicken with the yogurt, oil, garlic, shallots, paprika, oregano, turmeric, chili flakes and a good pinch of salt. Let it sit 15 minutes while you prep; the yogurt tenderizes and helps the spices cling. Heat the oven to 425F (220C).",
      "wait": "15 min",
      "uses": [
        "Chicken breasts or thighs",
        "Full-fat plain Greek yogurt",
        "Extra virgin olive oil",
        "Garlic",
        "Shallots",
        "Smoked paprika",
