        "Garlic cloves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "do": "While the chicken roasts, blend all the tahini ingredients until smooth. Add water a spoonful at a time until it pours, then taste for salt; it needs some.",
      "uses": [
        "Tahini",
        "Mixed fresh herbs: parsley, dill, basil or cilantro",
