        "Oil-packed sun-dried tomatoes",
        "Sliced dill pickles and/or pepperoncini",
        "Havarti",
        "Gouda"
      ],
      "hands": "6 min",
      "oven": "425F"
    },
    {
      "do": "Uncover. Pile on the sprouts and onions, drizzle with more dressing, and fold the bare half of each naan over the top, pressing gently. Rub the tops with oil, sprinkle with sesame seeds, and bake uncovered 5 to 10 minutes until toasted. Check at 5 minutes: naan overbrowns quickly.",
